            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db27aa"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Nanso mɛgya wɔ wo mu\n    wɔn a wɔdwo na wɔbrɛ wɔn ho ase,\n    na wɔde wɔn ho to Awurade so.",
        "reference": "Sefania 3:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3b531092a820bba8f6",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db288a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db27aa"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Israel nkaeɛfoɔ renyɛ bɔne\n    Wɔrenka nkontonpo nsɛm,\n  na wɔn ano renka nnaadaa nsɛm\n    wɔbɛdidi na wɔada\n    na obiara renyi wɔn hu.”",
        "reference": "Sefania 3:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3b531092a820bba939",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db288a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db27aa"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "To dwom Ao, Ɔbabaa Sion;\n    team denden Ao, Israel!\n  Ma wʼani nnye, na di ahurisie wɔ wʼakoma nyinaa mu,\n    Ao, Ɔbabaa Yerusalem!",
        "reference": "Sefania 3:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3b531092a820bba970",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db288a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db27aa"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Ɛfiri sɛ, Awurade ayi wʼasotweɛ afiri wo so,\n    wama wo ɔtamfoɔ asane nʼakyi.\n  Awurade Israelhene ka wo ho;\n    worensuro ɔhaw biara bio.",
        "reference": "Sefania 3:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3b531092a820bba9bb",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db288a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db27aa"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Saa ɛda no, wɔbɛka akyerɛ Yerusalem sɛ,\n    “Mma nsuro, Ao Sion!\n    Mma wo nsa mu nhodwo.",
        "reference": "Sefania 3:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3b531092a820bba9fc",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db288a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db27aa"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Awurade wo Onyankopɔn ne wo wɔ hɔ,\n    Ɔyɛ ɔgyefoɔ ɔhoɔdenfoɔ.\n  Nʼani bɛgye wo ho\n    ɔfiri ne dɔ mu bɛdwodwo wo,\n    ɔde nnwontoɔ bɛma nʼani agye wo ho.",
        "reference": "Sefania 3:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3b531092a820bbaa2c",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.18",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db288a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db27aa"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "“Mo awerɛhoɔ to bɛtwa\n    ɛfiri sɛ mobɛnya ɛkwan adi mo afahyɛ no;\n    mo anim rengu ase bio.",
        "reference": "Sefania 3:18",
        "verseNumber": "18",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3b531092a820bbaa62",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.19",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db288a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db27aa"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Saa ɛberɛ no me ne wɔn\n    a wɔhyɛɛ wo so nyinaa bɛdi;\n  Mɛgye mmerɛyɛfoɔ\n    na mɛboaboa wɔn a wɔabɔ wɔn ahwete no ano.\n  Mɛkamfo wɔn ahyɛ wɔn animuonyam\n    asase biara a wɔguu wɔn anim ase wɔ so no so.",
        "reference": "Sefania 3:19",
        "verseNumber": "19",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3b531092a820bbaa85",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.20",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db288a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc47999137613db27aa"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Saa ɛda no, mɛboaboa wo ano,\n    na mede wo aba fie.\n  Mɛhyɛ wo animuonyam na makamfo wo\n    wɔ asase so nnipa nyinaa mu\n  na mede wʼahonyadeɛ bɛsane ama wo\n    na wode wʼani bɛhunu,”\n    sɛdeɛ Awurade ka nie.",
        "reference": "Sefania 3:20",
        "verseNumber": "20",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    }
]